# Rank-one density certificate for the twenty-six-dimensional cycle model

A polynomial in five short actor words yields an outer product. Its column
and row have 26 independent translates. Two small inverse certificates then
show that the generated algebra is the full matrix algebra. All finite
computations use kernel reduction of packed binary rows.
-/

